# Cursor Rules (JME AI Finance Pipeline)
Goal: Build an AI pipeline that ingests messy/dynamic Excel files, normalizes to canonical tables, and supports:
- NL -> SQL analytics
- Monthly report packs

Rules:
- Never do arithmetic with the LLM. Use DuckDB/SQL for totals.
- LLM may only: classify sheet type, map columns, generate SELECT-only SQL.
- Validate generated SQL (no writes, no multiple statements).
- Keep code offline-first; Ollama runs locally/remote.
